1
00:00:09,620 --> 00:00:11,720
This is how I'll become.

2
00:00:13,420 --> 00:00:15,480
This is how I'll become.

3
00:00:18,420 --> 00:00:19,880
Supreme Commander!

4
00:00:20,900 --> 00:00:21,730
A hero!

5
00:00:21,813 --> 00:00:23,597
This is my story!

6
00:00:23,680 --> 00:00:25,337
All

7
00:00:25,420 --> 00:00:32,420
right.

8
00:00:58,300 --> 00:01:02,197
I was watching my dreams.

9
00:01:02,280 --> 00:01:06,737
It wasn't as high as I could!

10
00:01:06,820 --> 00:01:09,717
It wasn't as high as I could!

11
00:01:09,800 --> 00:01:14,297
I wanted to see that.

12
00:01:14,380 --> 00:01:16,617
That's when you were me?

13
00:01:16,700 --> 00:01:18,037
I was connected.

14
00:01:18,120 --> 00:01:19,420
How much is it?

15
00:01:19,960 --> 00:01:21,157
I'm going to move now.

16
00:01:21,240 --> 00:01:24,477
I'm going to come back.

17
00:01:24,560 --> 00:01:28,517
I'm going to come back.

18
00:01:28,600 --> 00:01:29,430
I must,

19
00:01:29,640 --> 00:01:30,737
I will do this moment!

20
00:01:30,820 --> 00:01:32,120
I will set the light.

21
00:01:32,800 --> 00:01:36,017
I will never change. I will never change.

22
00:01:36,100 --> 00:01:37,377
I will never change.

23
00:01:37,460 --> 00:01:38,880
I will never change.

24
00:02:23,560 --> 00:02:24,390
Good work.

25
00:02:24,560 --> 00:02:26,736
We put those monsters in their place.

26
00:02:33,460 --> 00:02:34,480
Well spotted.

27
00:02:38,260 --> 00:02:39,160
Attaboy, Yuki.

28
00:02:40,700 --> 00:02:41,940
She complimented me.

29
00:02:42,220 --> 00:02:43,320
This is great.

30
00:02:43,580 --> 00:02:45,933
At this rate, I'm bound to get stronger.

31
00:02:46,800 --> 00:02:50,380
If I'm lucky, I'll get strong
enough to protect Ms. Kyoka.

32
00:02:53,380 --> 00:02:56,640
So, what kind of reward
is this supposed to be?

33
00:02:57,200 --> 00:02:59,729
I haven't sustained
any injuries, you know.

34
00:02:59,880 --> 00:03:01,420
I'm not so sure myself.

35
00:03:02,860 --> 00:03:07,684
It's appropriate for Nei, but doing this
type of thing with me is a waste of time.

36
00:03:07,880 --> 00:03:08,840
Huh? No way!

37
00:03:09,060 --> 00:03:11,480
That's completely untrue! It's fine!

38
00:03:12,400 --> 00:03:13,280
Fine, then.

39
00:03:13,900 --> 00:03:16,280
I just don't understand your appetites.

40
00:03:16,740 --> 00:03:17,820
You pervert.

41
00:03:24,300 --> 00:03:26,540
Wow, our Yuki's making more progress.

42
00:03:26,880 --> 00:03:28,527
He follows my orders to a T,

43
00:03:28,720 --> 00:03:32,197
seeking out the most efficient method
on his own before taking action.

44
00:03:32,280 --> 00:03:33,720
That's fantastic, Yuki.

45
00:03:33,980 --> 00:03:35,420
Oh, no, it's nothing.

46
00:03:36,300 --> 00:03:40,037
Aw, you're so adorable in
your blushing little sleigh.

47
00:03:40,120 --> 00:03:41,480
Oh, Miss Tenka!

48
00:03:43,300 --> 00:03:46,777
Commander Izumo, don't you think you
should be heading back to your dorm?

49
00:03:46,860 --> 00:03:47,760
It'll be fine.

50
00:03:48,060 --> 00:03:49,600
You really are incredible.

51
00:03:49,820 --> 00:03:50,702
Good job today.

52
00:03:50,880 --> 00:03:52,939
Have you always been this talented?

53
00:03:53,300 --> 00:03:55,040
Hey! Knock it off!

54
00:03:57,700 --> 00:03:59,997
Well, I wouldn't say I'm talented exactly,

55
00:04:00,080 --> 00:04:03,492
but my big sister taught me a
lot when I was a little kid.

56
00:04:04,300 --> 00:04:06,160
Big sister? Oh, yeah.

57
00:04:06,460 --> 00:04:08,537
You said your big sister
was pretty cool, right?

58
00:04:08,620 --> 00:04:11,360
Oh, you must really admire her. Yeah.

59
00:04:12,980 --> 00:04:14,509
Tell us what she was like?

60
00:04:27,540 --> 00:04:28,880
Hey, Wakura!

61
00:04:29,120 --> 00:04:31,897
I don't like that you're
always ignoring me, idiot!

62
00:04:31,980 --> 00:04:33,157
You think I'm stupid?

63
00:04:33,240 --> 00:04:36,181
It's cause you're always
saying mean things to me!

64
00:04:37,620 --> 00:04:40,385
Come on, kid, play nice
with my little brother.

65
00:04:43,580 --> 00:04:46,020
Get your hands off my brother! Huh?

66
00:04:50,100 --> 00:04:50,930
Ha!

67
00:04:51,013 --> 00:04:52,300
Is that your sister?

68
00:05:02,000 --> 00:05:03,120
Yuki, are you...?

69
00:05:07,760 --> 00:05:10,857
I learned a move or two from
playing pro wrestler with you.

70
00:05:10,940 --> 00:05:12,764
I'm not some little wimp, okay?

71
00:05:15,660 --> 00:05:17,817
Now that's my precious little brother.

72
00:05:17,900 --> 00:05:18,960
You get an A+.

73
00:05:20,560 --> 00:05:21,760
You'll regret this.

74
00:05:22,160 --> 00:05:23,880
This calls for a celebration.

75
00:05:24,500 --> 00:05:25,897
Come on, let's go get a treat.

76
00:05:25,980 --> 00:05:26,810
I'll pay.

77
00:05:33,040 --> 00:05:34,720
That's just the way she was.

78
00:05:35,360 --> 00:05:37,125
She sounds like a good sister.

79
00:05:37,500 --> 00:05:40,017
She was training you and
you didn't even know it.

80
00:05:40,100 --> 00:05:43,217
Younger siblings sure do
have it rough sometimes, huh?

81
00:05:43,300 --> 00:05:45,888
I think we figured out
what makes Yuki tick!

82
00:05:46,960 --> 00:05:49,940
Yuki, take the rest of
the evening off. Thanks.

83
00:05:50,220 --> 00:05:51,937
I'll take a bath and then a nap.

84
00:05:52,020 --> 00:05:53,100
Go home, Tenka.

85
00:05:54,140 --> 00:05:55,800
I suppose it's getting late.

86
00:05:56,860 --> 00:05:58,480
I'll see you later.

87
00:06:07,520 --> 00:06:11,260
All this talk of big sisters
is making Ney feel jealous.

88
00:06:11,680 --> 00:06:14,137
So we're the only ones
without siblings, huh?

89
00:06:14,220 --> 00:06:17,985
I was the youngest in my family,
but everyone liked to spoil me.

90
00:06:18,240 --> 00:06:19,720
That sounds about right.

91
00:06:22,180 --> 00:06:24,040
I detect someone in danger!

92
00:06:24,260 --> 00:06:27,920
Four kilometers south! Himari!
Shushu! On the devil! Right!

93
00:06:47,940 --> 00:06:49,860
D .D .F. in the house!

94
00:06:50,040 --> 00:06:51,400
Relax, we got this!

95
00:06:59,520 --> 00:07:00,540
Are you okay?

96
00:07:01,220 --> 00:07:02,050
Yeah.

97
00:07:04,720 --> 00:07:05,661
Thanks for that!

98
00:07:10,260 --> 00:07:11,090
Kimari!

99
00:07:13,160 --> 00:07:15,260
Coco knows how to pack a punch.

100
00:07:15,620 --> 00:07:17,820
I caught some demon defense force.

101
00:07:18,280 --> 00:07:20,560
Now, let's make him suffer.

102
00:07:21,600 --> 00:07:22,720
Another humanoid?

103
00:07:22,920 --> 00:07:23,780
Hang it on!

104
00:07:23,980 --> 00:07:26,156
I'm gonna blast you in the next week!

105
00:07:26,240 --> 00:07:28,000
Kimari, are you good? Yeah.

106
00:07:29,740 --> 00:07:31,681
I blocked it in the nick of time.

107
00:07:33,400 --> 00:07:34,880
Hey, that's not bad.

108
00:07:41,780 --> 00:07:43,360
Hold on! Huh?

109
00:07:43,700 --> 00:07:45,380
Your name is Coco, correct?

110
00:07:46,200 --> 00:07:47,030
Huh?

111
00:07:47,160 --> 00:07:48,631
How did you know my name?

112
00:07:48,980 --> 00:07:51,451
Wait a minute, is that your Peach ability?

113
00:07:51,620 --> 00:07:52,450
Uh, no.

114
00:07:52,620 --> 00:07:54,973
You said Coco knows how to pack a punch.

115
00:07:55,760 --> 00:07:57,817
The Supreme Commander of the Demon Defense

116
00:07:57,900 --> 00:07:59,877
Force is willing to
negotiate with your kind.

117
00:07:59,960 --> 00:08:03,420
Will you hear us out? Ha! Dream on!

118
00:08:03,660 --> 00:08:05,520
I'm gonna destroy you!

119
00:08:07,360 --> 00:08:09,160
So many cuts and bruises.

120
00:08:09,580 --> 00:08:12,860
We've been fighting Shuki
left and right lately. Hmm?

121
00:08:13,380 --> 00:08:16,077
Well, at least my muscles
are coming along nicely.

122
00:08:16,160 --> 00:08:18,117
Keep getting those gains, my dude.

123
00:08:18,200 --> 00:08:19,030
All right!

124
00:08:19,113 --> 00:08:20,020
I'm coming in!

125
00:08:20,600 --> 00:08:21,860
Hey, Miss Kyoka!

126
00:08:22,140 --> 00:08:23,258
We're under attack.

127
00:08:23,400 --> 00:08:25,160
Time to transform. Wait!

128
00:08:25,360 --> 00:08:26,857
You mean, like, right this minute?

129
00:08:26,940 --> 00:08:27,770
Get a move on.

130
00:08:28,000 --> 00:08:29,941
Shushu and Himari are in trouble.

131
00:08:35,340 --> 00:08:37,260
My bullets can't pierce it!

132
00:08:37,700 --> 00:08:38,759
What do you think?

133
00:08:39,100 --> 00:08:40,880
Kuma's got mega-tough armor!

134
00:08:41,400 --> 00:08:42,230
Huh?

135
00:08:44,980 --> 00:08:47,620
I also have the ability to adapt!

136
00:08:57,080 --> 00:08:58,180
Cancel ability!

137
00:09:03,960 --> 00:09:05,317
It's a free-for-all.

138
00:09:05,400 --> 00:09:06,880
This ought to be fun.

139
00:09:07,340 --> 00:09:08,220
Take this!

140
00:09:10,680 --> 00:09:11,510
Nice.

141
00:09:11,593 --> 00:09:13,537
I wiped out all of the pint-sized Shuki.

142
00:09:13,620 --> 00:09:15,561
Now I just need a backup, Himari.

143
00:09:26,240 --> 00:09:27,070
It's...

144
00:09:27,153 --> 00:09:27,983
wielding a weapon?

145
00:09:48,380 --> 00:09:50,100
Now, it's one of them.

146
00:09:53,740 --> 00:09:55,300
You came out to play.

147
00:10:08,880 --> 00:10:10,260
Dodge it!

148
00:10:10,980 --> 00:10:12,060
Yuki!

149
00:10:12,380 --> 00:10:14,020
Quit building! Right!

150
00:10:20,760 --> 00:10:21,840
Yuki!

151
00:10:22,940 --> 00:10:24,600
Objective complete.

152
00:10:27,380 --> 00:10:28,900
No way!

153
00:10:42,120 --> 00:10:43,600
They... vanished?

154
00:10:50,060 --> 00:10:50,890
Really?

155
00:10:52,740 --> 00:10:54,060
They took him?

156
00:10:54,780 --> 00:10:58,133
Yuki must have been their
target from the very beginning.

157
00:10:58,480 --> 00:11:02,317
I guess that explains why the
humanoids showed up only to retreat.

158
00:11:02,400 --> 00:11:04,812
They had already accomplished their goal.

159
00:11:06,340 --> 00:11:07,170
Yuki.

160
00:11:08,040 --> 00:11:08,870
Commander!

161
00:11:09,480 --> 00:11:10,680
Back to the dorm.

162
00:11:14,480 --> 00:11:16,892
Your wounds need medical attention first.

163
00:11:17,200 --> 00:11:19,906
We'll take a quick
breather and regroup after.

164
00:11:32,260 --> 00:11:34,380
Where are you?

165
00:11:42,160 --> 00:11:43,920
Big sis?

166
00:11:44,720 --> 00:11:45,860
Huh?

167
00:11:46,280 --> 00:11:48,400
That feels really good.

168
00:11:57,200 --> 00:11:59,760
Settle down and keep yourself still.

169
00:12:01,800 --> 00:12:05,020
You'll be better in no
time, so bear with me, okay?

170
00:12:07,680 --> 00:12:08,510
That's right.

171
00:12:08,840 --> 00:12:10,457
I remember getting captured.

172
00:12:10,540 --> 00:12:14,440
And now I've woken up to the
enemy licking my whole body.

173
00:12:16,180 --> 00:12:17,757
Wait, first things first.

174
00:12:17,840 --> 00:12:22,320
During the fight when she
yelled my name, I knew it.

175
00:12:22,760 --> 00:12:24,440
That was my sister.

176
00:12:24,940 --> 00:12:25,880
Hey, can you?

177
00:12:27,800 --> 00:12:29,280
Hey, stop squirming.

178
00:12:29,400 --> 00:12:30,929
I'm trying to be thorough.

179
00:12:31,200 --> 00:12:34,800
Am I being assaulted by the enemy?

180
00:12:35,120 --> 00:12:36,340
What do I do?

181
00:12:36,880 --> 00:12:41,260
All righty, looks like we're in
the clear. How's Yuki? Is he awake?

182
00:12:44,400 --> 00:12:45,577
Uh... Hey, Alba.

183
00:12:45,660 --> 00:12:47,660
You're just in time for...

184
00:12:50,160 --> 00:12:51,220
Damn it, Coco!

185
00:12:51,480 --> 00:12:54,557
What the hell would possess
you to strip my brother naked?!

186
00:12:54,640 --> 00:12:56,520
Such an ugly misunderstanding.

187
00:12:57,280 --> 00:12:58,110
Huh?

188
00:12:58,193 --> 00:13:01,420
He was naked when his
transformation was broken.

189
00:13:01,760 --> 00:13:03,740
He also had several injuries.

190
00:13:04,100 --> 00:13:06,340
That's why Coco was healing him.

191
00:13:06,500 --> 00:13:08,620
Beauty of the self-sacrificing sort.

192
00:13:08,740 --> 00:13:10,697
I did it because he's your brother!

193
00:13:10,780 --> 00:13:13,177
I wanted to heal every
left scratch on him!

194
00:13:13,260 --> 00:13:16,700
Now that you mention it, all
of my scratches are gone.

195
00:13:16,840 --> 00:13:18,160
It's my saliva.

196
00:13:18,380 --> 00:13:20,400
It's got medicinal properties.

197
00:13:20,820 --> 00:13:23,360
She did say you would
be better in no time.

198
00:13:24,960 --> 00:13:26,660
I'm so sorry, Coco.

199
00:13:26,920 --> 00:13:27,857
Thanks for helping.

200
00:13:27,940 --> 00:13:29,940
I'll treat you to something yummy.

201
00:13:31,620 --> 00:13:33,040
Always one to reward.

202
00:13:33,440 --> 00:13:34,880
It really is you.

203
00:13:43,480 --> 00:13:45,020
It's been too long.

204
00:13:45,220 --> 00:13:46,985
You're all grown up now, Yuki.

205
00:13:54,380 --> 00:13:55,617
You were alive.

206
00:13:55,700 --> 00:13:57,260
The entire time.

207
00:13:58,340 --> 00:14:01,281
You'll never be able to
get rid of me that easily.

208
00:14:01,740 --> 00:14:02,680
Big sis.

209
00:14:04,920 --> 00:14:06,500
I guess it all worked out.

210
00:14:07,160 --> 00:14:09,680
Sibling love, it's a beautiful thing.

211
00:14:10,020 --> 00:14:12,457
But wait a sec, why do you look like that?

212
00:14:12,540 --> 00:14:14,716
You're the one not wearing any pants.

213
00:14:16,320 --> 00:14:18,420
My, my, you really have grown.

214
00:14:21,520 --> 00:14:23,060
Go ahead and put these on.

215
00:14:23,280 --> 00:14:25,337
We'll take a walk outside afterwards.

216
00:14:25,420 --> 00:14:30,440
Given the location and how we all appear,
it would be faster just to show you.

217
00:14:46,720 --> 00:14:49,620
We refer to it as the Hidden Village.

218
00:14:50,100 --> 00:14:52,297
There aren't any peach trees in the area,

219
00:14:52,380 --> 00:14:56,086
so the Demon Defense Force doesn't
come poking around out here.

220
00:14:59,540 --> 00:15:02,364
So then there are others
who look just like you.

221
00:15:02,560 --> 00:15:04,736
About 20 people call this place home.

222
00:15:04,860 --> 00:15:06,037
All are former humans.

223
00:15:06,120 --> 00:15:07,217
Like the three of us.

224
00:15:07,300 --> 00:15:08,780
I'm Coco Zenibako!

225
00:15:11,760 --> 00:15:13,500
I now own you know.

226
00:15:16,280 --> 00:15:18,580
Oh, so Shuki start off as humans?

227
00:15:18,820 --> 00:15:21,057
Well, those things are
full-blooded monsters.

228
00:15:21,140 --> 00:15:22,964
We happen to be a special case.

229
00:15:23,120 --> 00:15:26,061
It's a half-human,
half-monster kind of situation.

230
00:15:26,740 --> 00:15:32,620
An accident caused us to end up like this,
but our souls are still human like yours.

231
00:15:35,340 --> 00:15:36,777
It's a pretty nice setup.

232
00:15:36,860 --> 00:15:39,620
And from now on, you
and I can live together!

233
00:15:40,640 --> 00:15:41,470
Don't worry!

234
00:15:41,700 --> 00:15:44,537
You won't have to deal with being
treated like a slave anymore!

235
00:15:44,620 --> 00:15:46,337
Whoa, just slow down a minute!

236
00:15:46,420 --> 00:15:48,777
There's no reason for
you to hide, big sis!

237
00:15:48,860 --> 00:15:49,742
You're a human!

238
00:15:51,340 --> 00:15:53,222
Talk to the Demon Defense Force!

239
00:15:53,360 --> 00:15:54,536
They'll protect you!

240
00:15:56,880 --> 00:15:58,360
That's not an option!

241
00:15:58,800 --> 00:16:01,220
The Demon Defense Force is our enemy!

242
00:16:03,280 --> 00:16:08,500
They enslaved you, and with the way their
hierarchy works, we can never be allies.

243
00:16:09,860 --> 00:16:11,640
A battle is inevitable.

244
00:16:13,680 --> 00:16:16,092
They were friendly up until a minute ago.

245
00:16:19,140 --> 00:16:20,700
What the hell happened?

246
00:16:26,040 --> 00:16:27,540
Are you okay?

247
00:16:28,040 --> 00:16:30,317
You're really lucky the
wound isn't very deep.

248
00:16:30,400 --> 00:16:31,988
I think this should fix it.

249
00:16:32,380 --> 00:16:34,060
Yeah, I'll be just fine.

250
00:16:34,520 --> 00:16:37,696
Besides, I'm way more worried
about how Yuki is doing.

251
00:16:37,960 --> 00:16:39,940
I can't act like a whiny baby.

252
00:16:41,080 --> 00:16:41,910
Hey, Nei!

253
00:16:41,993 --> 00:16:43,720
Did you find him? Mm-mm.

254
00:16:45,020 --> 00:16:49,180
I asked the other squads to
help me look, but no luck. Ugh.

255
00:16:50,040 --> 00:16:51,746
I'll try widening the search.

256
00:16:52,320 --> 00:16:53,150
Good idea.

257
00:16:53,360 --> 00:16:55,536
I wonder what the commander is doing.

258
00:16:55,640 --> 00:16:59,405
She's been holed up inside her
room ever since we got back home.

259
00:17:02,300 --> 00:17:07,200
The Supreme Commander has issued an order
that no one is to attack the humanoids,

260
00:17:07,320 --> 00:17:08,150
right?

261
00:17:08,233 --> 00:17:09,063
Maybe that's why.

262
00:17:09,160 --> 00:17:13,320
Yeah, but while we're just
sitting around, Yuki might...

263
00:17:14,300 --> 00:17:18,757
The fact they abducted him tells me that
they've got a specific goal in mind.

264
00:17:18,840 --> 00:17:21,220
I'm sure he's safe, so don't worry.

265
00:17:21,700 --> 00:17:24,641
The Commander will come
up with a plan of her own.

266
00:17:34,580 --> 00:17:36,237
Obeying someone other than me?

267
00:17:36,320 --> 00:17:38,555
He's in big trouble when he gets back.

268
00:17:55,120 --> 00:17:57,320
Big Sis, what's going on?

269
00:17:57,520 --> 00:18:00,049
How did you even know
how to find Nianmato?

270
00:18:01,300 --> 00:18:03,757
I could sense my little
brother's presence here.

271
00:18:03,840 --> 00:18:04,670
Really?

272
00:18:04,753 --> 00:18:05,583
You can do that?

273
00:18:05,666 --> 00:18:06,820
Of course I can!

274
00:18:07,340 --> 00:18:09,060
It's my job to find you.

275
00:18:09,340 --> 00:18:13,777
And I didn't want to overinflate your
ego, so I kept my mouth shut back then.

276
00:18:13,860 --> 00:18:16,937
But you're all grown up now,
so I can shout it out loud!

277
00:18:17,020 --> 00:18:19,432
You're a bona fide bunch of hottie, Yuki!

278
00:18:19,600 --> 00:18:21,424
Wouldn't you two totally agree?

279
00:18:23,040 --> 00:18:23,870
Yep.

280
00:18:24,340 --> 00:18:25,170
Sure do.

281
00:18:25,820 --> 00:18:26,700
Hell yeah!

282
00:18:28,440 --> 00:18:29,720
Sorry about her!

283
00:18:33,920 --> 00:18:36,880
I'll go and get you
something to eat. Big sis!

284
00:18:40,240 --> 00:18:42,960
I know my sister can
be a little unorthodox.

285
00:18:43,300 --> 00:18:44,917
Is it hard working with her?

286
00:18:45,000 --> 00:18:46,765
A little is an understatement.

287
00:18:47,040 --> 00:18:49,800
Yes, but everyone here adores Alba.

288
00:18:50,160 --> 00:18:51,320
Her flaws included.

289
00:18:57,200 --> 00:18:59,729
Whatever you've got
there smells delicious.

290
00:19:00,400 --> 00:19:02,897
We grow these mato mushrooms
in the Hidden Village.

291
00:19:02,980 --> 00:19:05,100
The flavor and aroma are immaculate.

292
00:19:05,380 --> 00:19:06,700
Energizing, too. Mmm.

293
00:19:07,320 --> 00:19:09,261
It smells sweet like fruit juice.

294
00:19:09,500 --> 00:19:12,441
I wonder what ingredients
it would pair well with.

295
00:19:13,560 --> 00:19:14,390
What's wrong?

296
00:19:15,520 --> 00:19:16,540
Oh, dear.

297
00:19:17,340 --> 00:19:20,516
Despite the accident, I take
great pride in my beauty.

298
00:19:20,800 --> 00:19:23,094
Has Nell mesmerized you with her looks?

299
00:19:25,100 --> 00:19:26,160
Are you all right?

300
00:19:26,820 --> 00:19:28,480
Oh, big sis.

301
00:19:29,160 --> 00:19:31,840
Marcus, you brought me
some tasty meat buns!

302
00:19:34,180 --> 00:19:35,620
Time to dig in!

303
00:19:36,020 --> 00:19:39,037
These are just field rations I
swiped from the defense force,

304
00:19:39,120 --> 00:19:40,860
but for now it ought to be...

305
00:19:41,660 --> 00:19:43,580
Mmm, what a nice texture!

306
00:19:44,780 --> 00:19:47,760
I took my eyes off you for two seconds!

307
00:19:52,180 --> 00:19:53,900
Everyone, prepare to depart!

308
00:19:54,280 --> 00:19:56,515
Does that mean you know where Yuki is?

309
00:19:57,520 --> 00:20:01,920
My body began moving automatically,
which implies... It's Yuki!

310
00:20:02,320 --> 00:20:04,337
His transformation must have broken!

311
00:20:04,420 --> 00:20:05,440
I get it!

312
00:20:05,640 --> 00:20:07,169
The price of your ability!

313
00:20:07,460 --> 00:20:12,260
If I have to give him a reward, that makes
me a living, breathing Yuki detector!

314
00:20:15,320 --> 00:20:17,438
Are you feeling a little better now?

315
00:20:18,320 --> 00:20:19,150
Mm-hmm.

316
00:20:19,233 --> 00:20:20,380
I'm so sorry.

317
00:20:20,980 --> 00:20:21,810
Huh?

318
00:20:22,040 --> 00:20:23,720
What is it? Hmm.

319
00:20:23,980 --> 00:20:26,451
It felt like old times for a second there.

320
00:20:27,000 --> 00:20:30,824
The fact that you're actually
sitting next to me finally sunk in.

321
00:20:31,080 --> 00:20:32,040
Oh, I see.

322
00:20:33,820 --> 00:20:36,420
Hey, isn't that a Mato peach?

323
00:20:37,180 --> 00:20:38,010
Uh-huh.

324
00:20:38,280 --> 00:20:41,077
You hadn't eaten one until
after we were separated, right?

325
00:20:41,160 --> 00:20:42,160
Can you blame me?

326
00:20:42,320 --> 00:20:45,137
The procedures and the
paperwork were a headache.

327
00:20:45,220 --> 00:20:47,691
Quite a few people choose not to eat them.

328
00:20:48,020 --> 00:20:48,920
It's just,

329
00:20:49,280 --> 00:20:53,809
well, I had assumed your powers were a
direct result from eating the peaches.

330
00:20:54,700 --> 00:20:56,840
There is a connection between them.

331
00:20:59,080 --> 00:21:03,315
In fact, the truth is, the peaches
are what caused us to look like this.

332
00:21:04,280 --> 00:21:06,120
I want to hear the whole story!

333
00:21:08,660 --> 00:21:09,778
You stay here, Nay.

334
00:21:10,100 --> 00:21:11,924
Keep in contact with HQ for us.

335
00:21:12,680 --> 00:21:15,337
If something should happen,
let me know immediately.

336
00:21:15,420 --> 00:21:16,596
Just leave it to me!

337
00:21:32,880 --> 00:21:35,660
We're a united front. Let's move!

338
00:21:53,960 --> 00:21:55,607
I'm not going to let you go.

339
00:22:10,900 --> 00:22:12,757
I'm not going to work for you,
but I'm not going to work for you!

340
00:22:12,840 --> 00:22:17,080
I'm not going to be a person,

341
00:22:17,220 --> 00:22:21,200
but I'm not going to work for you.

342
00:22:50,560 --> 00:22:52,737
I'm going to get the needle in the ring.

343
00:22:52,820 --> 00:22:54,200
I'm going to get hurt.

344
00:22:55,740 --> 00:22:57,720
I'm going to get you in a chain.

345
00:22:58,940 --> 00:23:01,240
I'm not going to ever leave you.

346
00:23:02,580 --> 00:23:05,440
I'm not going to be left.

347
00:23:20,560 --> 00:23:21,913
Special Defense Forces.

348
00:23:22,040 --> 00:23:25,417
Only women endowed with the benefits
of the peaches are permitted to join.

349
00:23:25,500 --> 00:23:27,877
And aside from combat,
there are other roles too?

350
00:23:27,960 --> 00:23:31,477
Like creating armor out of peach
abilities, like how Ne gathers intel.

351
00:23:31,560 --> 00:23:35,297
It's an extremely difficult job, but it
comes with the honor of rescuing people.

352
00:23:35,380 --> 00:23:37,780
Anyway, next time, we're not on Resight.
